SetPauserTest
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when pauser is zero address
│   │   └── it should set pauser status and emit event
│   ├── when pauser is non-zero address
│   │   ├── when pauseType is zero
│   │   │   ├── when status is false
│   │   │   │   └── it should remove pauser status and emit event
│   │   │   └── when status is true
│   │   │       └── it should set pauser status and emit event
│   │   └── when pauseType is non-zero
│   │       ├── when status is false
│   │       │   └── it should remove pauser status and emit event
│   │       └── when status is true
│   │           └── it should set pauser status and emit event
│   └── when pauser already has status
│       ├── when changing from true to false
│       │   └── it should update status and emit event
│       └── when changing from false to true
│           └── it should update status and emit event 